 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "32: both tafsirs read «نور الله» as His religion; wind for «يطفئوا… بأفواههم», light for «يتم نوره». The reciter joins 32 to 33 (no clean cut), so 32-35 is one unit. 33: light for «بالهدى» (after «رسوله»), geometric for «على الدين كله»; As-Sa'di's «والسيف والسنان» is not used. 34 keeps «كثيرا» (many, not all) and Al-Muyassar's definition of hoarding (withholding zakat). Coins leave before «فبشرهم بعذاب أليم»; no gold motif and nothing drawn in 35 (Hell): night sky only."
 },
